.TH MORSE-RUNNER 1 "November 2026" "Morse Runner" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
morse-runner \- CW contest practice simulator
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B morse-runner
.RI [ --audio-check ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B morse-runner
is a desktop application for practicing amateur-radio CW contest contacts.
It simulates callers, radio conditions, Morse transmissions, and QSO logging.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --audio-check
Open the default audio output device, verify the stream briefly, and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/MorseRunner/
Application settings and session records on Linux. Existing data in
.I ~/.local/share/MorseRunnerRust/
is migrated on first launch.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR xdg-open (1)
